最後に笑うのは僕らだろう　君の心が必要で　僕の心は執拗だ
We'll be the ones laughing in the end—your heart is needed, and my heart is relentless!

66
00:10:18,216 --> 00:10:21,816
あてずっぽを繰り返しちゃうように見えてるとしても
Even if it looks like we're just repeating random guesses...

67
00:10:22,016 --> 00:10:25,816
結局僕らが勝利しちゃうから狂騒をくれよ！
...in the end we'll be the ones who win, so give us the pandemonium!

68
00:10:33,216 --> 00:10:39,816
晴天なり 曇天なり 荒天なり　結構 決行　ノイズごときで屈服とか　世話がないぜ
Fair weather, cloudy weather, stormy weather—fine, let's go. Yielding to mere noise is too easy!

69
00:10:41,816 --> 00:10:47,016
竜頭蛇尾 叫喚阿鼻 うっせえヤミー　あまさず 皿まで食べるが　紳士のたしなみさ
Anti-climactic, wailing and gnashing of teeth, noisy yamy—eating everything down to the plate is a gentleman's refinement.

70
