72
00:11:01,516 --> 00:11:07,516
一寸先が闇だなんて言いだしたやつから順番にさよならだ
Say goodbye, starting one by one with the ones who claim that an inch ahead is darkness!

73
00:11:14,216 --> 00:11:21,016
Shake the world! ここにルールなんてない 映画の世界みたいに free
Shake the world! There are no rules here, free like in a movie world.

74
00:11:21,216 --> 00:11:25,816
言葉にできそうなら そっか それは魔法じゃない
If it seems like it can be put into words, oh well—that's not magic.

75
00:11:26,016 --> 00:11:31,516
Shake the world! 遊んでいたいだけ 脳裏によぎった フィクション事情
Shake the world! I just want to play, fiction circumstances flashing across my mind.

76
00:11:31,816 --> 00:11:36,516
王様はきっといなくなる なら僕らはどうしよう？
The king will surely disappear, so what should we do?

77
00:11:37,016 --> 00:11:43,016
展望を見るにR-指定 では 立ち入り禁止 sorry, keep out
Judging by the outlook, it's R-rated—so keep out, sorry, keep out.

78
00:11:43,516 --> 00:11:51,516
平行線のランデブー いつか息絶えるまで 傾向はどうなってく？ もうどうでもいいぜ順風なんざ
A rendezvous on parallel lines until we breathe our last—how are trends going? I don't care about favorable winds anymore!

79
00:11:52,516 --> 00:12:00,016
アイデアが情緒 満帆じゃなけりゃ 新世紀エンジンで代用しろ Jet してくれ ありったけ！
If your ideas and emotions aren't in full sail, substitute them with a new-century engine—jet me with everything you've got!

80
00:12:03,016 --> 00:12:09,516
ああ いけない fool logic 手札に bad joker が あったって躊躇わない
Ah, forbidden fool logic—even if there's a bad joker in your hand, don't hesitate.

81
00:12:10,016 --> 00:12:13,516
単刀直で shake the world!
Go straight to the point and shake the world!

82
00:12:14,016 --> 00:12:21,016
