85
00:12:38,016 --> 00:12:42,516
結局僕らが勝利しちゃうから 狂騒をくれよ！
...in the end we'll be the ones who win, so give us the pandemonium!

86
00:13:19,016 --> 00:13:26,516
願った 勇敢な選択の 未来を今照らしてく
Illuminating the future of the brave choice we wished for right now...

87
00:13:36,016 --> 00:13:41,516
利己的な感情 ぶつけあっちゃ（まだ）見えないね
We clash selfish emotions together—(still) can't see it yet.

88
00:13:41,816 --> 00:13:45,516
逃げて来た分の距離を埋める ほら旅に出よう
Fill the distance we ran away from—come on, let's set out on a journey!

89
00:13:46,016 --> 00:13:52,016
最果てなんて 見られなくても 命を燃やして今を生きていくだけだから
Even if we can't see the ends of the earth, we're just going to burn our lives and live in the present!

90
00:13:59,516 --> 00:14:06,516
願った 存在の証明を 声を震わせ続けて 振りかざしてきたから
The proof of the existence we wished for—we've kept our voices trembling and wielded it forward.

91
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:17,516
後悔は要らない 手を取り合って（暗い過去だって）受け止めて進んでいく
No regrets, taking each other's hands, accepting (even a dark past) and moving forward.

92
00:14:21,016 --> 00:14:29,016
示された答え選ぶより 新しい夢を目指すから
Rather than choosing the answer that was shown to us, I'll aim for a new dream!

93
00:14:31,016 --> 00:14:36,016
（ずっと）眩しい道を歩いていこう
Let's keep walking down the dazzling path forever!

94
00:14:46,016 --> 00:14:52,516
リスクを秘めた道にだって（きっと）夢はある ふたりしかない可能性をほら見つけよう
Even on a path concealing risks, surely there are dreams—come on, let's find the possibility only the two of us share!

95
00:14:57,016 --> 00:15:00,016
最果てよりも
Even further than the ends of the earth...

96
00:17:30,174 --> 00:17:35,824
ほらまた君の前で 涙を見せてしまった
Look, I ended up showing you my tears right in front of you again.

97
00:17:36,024 --> 00:17:41,874
何があってもずっと 離れないって言ってくれた
You told me that no matter what happened, you would never leave my side.

98
00:17:42,124 --> 00:17:47,824
誰かを守り抜くと 誰かに罪を作る
To protect someone is to create sin for another.

99
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:53,424
生きるほど愛を知って 心は強くなる
The more we live and know love, the stronger our hearts become.

100
00:17:54,024 --> 00:18:04,524
目の奥に映る過去の傷は 私が飲み干すから
I will drink down the scars of the past reflected deep in my eyes...

101
00:18:06,524 --> 00:18:18,424
君の存在だけで世界は万華鏡みたいにくるくる回って光が射す
Just your existence makes the world spin around and round like a kaleidoscope as the light shines through.

102
00:18:19,024 --> 00:18:33,524
変わる季節と変わらない笑い声 君は思い出にならないよ ここにいるから
With the changing seasons and unchanging laughter, you won't become just a memory, because you are right here.

103
00:18:45,224 --> 00:18:50,324
真夜中ベンチで言った まだかさぶたの過去を
In the middle of the night on the bench, speaking of the past whose scabs had yet to heal...

104
00:18:50,824 --> 00:18:56,524
綺麗に剥がしたの 温かい君の手
You cleanly peeled them away with your warm hand.

