291
00:38:24,056 --> 00:38:30,556
ただ苦しみに慣れて耐えているだけじゃ 死んでいるも同然屍のアンデッド
Just getting used to suffering and enduring it is tantamount to being dead, a corpse Undead

292
00:38:31,056 --> 00:38:36,556
Unhappy? 悩める人の子よ
Unhappy? Troubled child of humanity

293
00:38:36,556 --> 00:38:43,056
Unlucky? 人成らざる者も Be happy! 弛まず目指せよ アンデッド！生きているんだろ
Unlucky? Even non-human beings, Be happy! Aim unflinchingly, Undead! You're alive

294
00:38:43,056 --> 00:38:47,056
不幸に浸るも 幸せになるのも そう全部全部お前だ 古今東西 一切合切
Whether drowning in misfortune or becoming happy, yes, it's all, all you, far and wide, everything

295
00:38:47,056 --> 00:38:52,556
森羅万象 ピースピース Past and future can't change the past Past and future, run for the future
All creation, peace, peace, Past and future can't change the past, Past and future, run for the future

296
00:38:53,056 --> 00:39:00,056
人の在る所に何時も憂い事 生き抜けこの化物ばかりの物語
