374
00:47:32,072 --> 00:47:37,657
じゃあ、じゃあ、じゃあ、脱いでる間にマリンが1枚脱ごうかな？
Well then, while she's taking it off, should Marine take one layer off?

375
00:47:37,837 --> 00:47:40,897
え、脱いでましたよ！え、どこどこ？どれ？
Eh, she already took it off! Eh, where where? Which one?

376
